📘 Keystone Solutions — Help Documentation
🔷 Overview

Keystone Solutions helps teams understand how work actually happens—so they can make better decisions, earlier.

By combining sprint data, team availability, meeting load, and historical patterns, Keystone surfaces delivery risk, capacity constraints, and actionable insights—before they impact outcomes.

🚀 Getting Started
1. Install Keystone
Install from Atlassian Marketplace
Open Keystone from your Jira project sidebar
2. Initial Setup (Admin)
Configure Sprint Capacity (Maximum Hours)
Select Estimate Fields
Select Actual Fields (optional)
Configure Milestone Calendar (Sprint Timeline)
3. You’re Ready

Keystone immediately begins analyzing your active sprint.

