⚠️ Key Concepts
Capacity Realism

Keystone does not predict outcomes.
It shows whether your plan is realistic based on actual constraints.

Sprint Disruption

Measures work added/removed after sprint start.
→ This is normal, expected, and tracked.

Unplanned Work

Tracks interruptions (support, urgent work).
→ Treated as part of real capacity.

At-Risk Work

Identifies tickets likely to fall behind based on:

Time elapsed
Current progress
🧠 Best Practices
Review Sprint Health Score at sprint start
Use Active Work daily for visibility
