⚡ Getting Value in 5 Minutes

You don’t need a full setup to start seeing value from Keystone. Follow these steps to quickly understand your sprint reality.

🕐 Minute 1: Open Keystone
Navigate to your Jira project
Open Keystone Solutions from the sidebar
Keystone will automatically load your active sprint

👉 No setup required to begin

🧭 Minute 2: Check Sprint Health

Go to Team Overview

Look at your Sprint Health Score (0–100)
Scan the key signals:
Capacity Fit
Risk %
Delivery Pace
Sprint Disruption

👉 Ask: Does this sprint look realistic?

👀 Minute 3: Review Active Work

Go to Active Work

Check your Sprint Timeline
Look for:
Work behind schedule
Clusters of “In Progress” work
Gaps between progress and time elapsed

👉 Ask: Are we where we should be right now?

⚠️ Minute 4: Identify Risk

Return to Team Overview

Look at:
At-risk tickets
High Risk %
Low Capacity Fit

👉 These are your early warning signs

📅 Minute 5: Check Your Real Capacity

Go to Calendar

Review today’s meetings
Compare meeting load vs available work time

👉 Ask: Do we actually have time to deliver this work?

